    AzureActiveDirectory --> agwprodeastus001
    agwprodeastus001 --> AzureStorageTiers
    AzureStorageTiers --> AzureSpotVMs
    AzureSpotVMs --> appprodeastus001
    appprodeastus001 --> AzureCDN
    AzureCDN --> AzureCacheforRedis

